# Only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md, alembic.ini, src/, and scripts/
# enter the image. README.md is not documentation ballast: pyproject.toml
# declares `readme = "README.md"`, so uv_build opens it while building the
# project and the build fails without it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src
!scripts
src/**/__pycache__
scripts/**/__pycache__
